	<div class="content" id="forum_op_content_574930972896765415">
		I have installed the LTS file, currently being given &quot;The Agent exited. Verify installation and login in a terminal, and check the launch parameters.&quot; The terminal login/setup command does not have a command copyable. I did some digging, but nothing seems to be working. Running Gemini CLI.	</div>
		
